      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصوّك فِى رَجِيعِهِ</span></b> , (As, O, K,) or, accord. to
AZ, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تضوّك</span>, with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ض</span>, (O,) or both, (Lh, TA in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صف</span>,) [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تصوق</span>,] <i>He</i> (a man, O) <i>became
defiled,</i> or <i>befouled, with</i> [or <i>in</i>] <i>his dung.</i>
(O, K.)

